      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">An embedding space modeling technique used to capture semantic ties between different components by mapping words into a continuous vector space.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f14a9ca99a33848e15f3d4e962728fa6</data>
      <data key="d4">pdfs/graphrag/graphrag survey paper 2.pdf</data>
