      <data key="d0">Hallucinations</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A notable drawback of LLMs where they generate incorrect, nonsensical, or unfaithful information, which GraphRAG aims to mitigate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0a66952372ea2d9c4c7043097a13cc6</data>
