    <node id="GraphRAG-FI (Filtering &amp; Integration)">
      <data key="d0">GraphRAG-FI (Filtering &amp; Integration)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The novel framework proposed in this paper, designed to improve GraphRAG by employing a two-stage filtering mechanism and a logits-based selection strategy to balance external knowledge with LLM intrinsic reasoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0a66952372ea2d9c4c7043097a13cc6</data>
      <data key="d4">pdfs/graphrag/graphrag knowledge filtering.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1753720497</data>
    </node>
