      <data key="d0">Community-based GraphRAG</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A representative GraphRAG method that generates knowledge graphs and hierarchical communities using graph community detection algorithms, with retrieval options like Local Search and Global Search.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a83834acbef8d77bea1f43033aef4cf4</data>
      <data key="d4">pdfs/graphrag/rag vs graphrag.pdf</data>
